### Candidate Engagement API - REST Client Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###

### Test 1: Update Stage - Create and Screen
POST {{baseUrl}}/hr/engagement/stage/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "candidateId": "CAND-001",
  "jobId": "JOB-101",
  "newStage": "SCREENED"
}

###

### Test 2: Update Stage - Schedule Interview
POST {{baseUrl}}/hr/engagement/stage/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "candidateId": "CAND-001",
  "jobId": "JOB-101",
  "newStage": "INTERVIEW_SCHEDULED"
}

###

### Test 3: Update Stage - Interviewed
POST {{baseUrl}}/hr/engagement/stage/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "candidateId": "CAND-001",
  "jobId": "JOB-101",
  "newStage": "INTERVIEWED"
}

###

### Test 4: Update Stage - Offered
POST {{baseUrl}}/hr/engagement/stage/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "candidateId": "CAND-001",
  "jobId": "JOB-101",
  "newStage": "OFFERED"
}

###

### Test 5: Invalid Transition (Should Fail)
# This should return 400 error - trying to skip stages
POST {{baseUrl}}/hr/engagement/stage/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "candidateId": "CAND-002",
  "jobId": "JOB-102",
  "newStage": "OFFERED"
}

###

### Test 6: Move to Closed State
POST {{baseUrl}}/hr/engagement/stage/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "candidateId": "CAND-003",
  "jobId": "JOB-103",
  "newStage": "CLOSED_REJECTED"
}

###

